rs &gt;= 2]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 卫语句结构&#10;    A2[check active] --&gt; B2[check subscription]&#10;    B2 --&gt; C2[check trial]&#10;    C2 --&gt; D2[check loyalty 5+]&#10;    D2 --&gt; E2[check loyalty 2+]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 嵌套结构\n    A1[if active] --&gt; B1[if subscription]\n    B1 --&gt; C1[if trial]\n    C1 --&gt; D1[if loyaltyYears &gt;= 5]\n    D1 --&gt; E1[if loyaltyYears &gt;= 2]\n    end\n    subgraph 卫语句结构\n    A2[check active] --&gt; B2[check subscription]\n    B2 --&gt; C2[check trial]\n    C2 --&gt; D2[check loyalty 5+]\n    D2 --&gt; E2[check loyalty 2+]\n    end</pre><p>嵌套结构要求读者同时记住所有外层条件；卫语句结构每一行都是独立的，消除了就不再占用工作记忆。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用解释变量替代复杂表达式\">用解释变量替代复杂表达式</h3><p>当一个表达式的含义不能一眼看出时，引入一个命名中间变量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const isEligibleForFreeShipping =&#10;  order.subtotal &gt;= FREE_SHIPPING_THRESHOLD &amp;&amp; !order.hasOversizedItems &amp;&amp; shippingZone !== ShippingZone.Remote;&#10;&#10;const requiresManagerApproval =&#10;  order.total &gt;= APPROVAL_THRESHOLD || order.containsRestrictedItems || customer.riskScore &gt; HIGH_RISK_THRESHOLD;&#10;&#10;if (isEligibleForFreeShipping &amp;&amp; !requiresManagerApproval) {&#10;  applyFreeShipping(order);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> isEligibleForFreeShipping</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order.subtotal </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> FREE_SHIPPING_THRESHOLD</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">order.hasOversizedItems </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shippingZone </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ShippingZone.Remote;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> requiresManagerApproval</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order.total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> APPROVAL_THRESHOLD</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order.containsRestrictedItems </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer.riskScore </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> HIGH_RISK_THRESHOLD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (isEligibleForFreeShipping </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">requiresManagerApproval) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  applyFreeShipping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"用查找表替代条件链\">用查找表替代条件链</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const statusConfig: Record&lt;OrderStatus, StatusDisplay&gt; = {&#10;  pending: { label: &#39;待处理&#39;, color: &#39;#f59e0b&#39;, icon: &#39;clock&#39; },&#10;  confirmed: { label: &#39;已确认&#39;, color: &#39;#3b82f6&#39;, icon: &#39;check&#39; },&#10;  shipped: { label: &#39;已发货&#39;, color: &#39;#8b5cf6&#39;, icon: &#39;truck&#39; },&#10;  delivered: { label: &#39;已送达&#39;, color: &#39;#10b981&#39;, icon: &#39;package&#39; },&#10;  cancelled: { label: &#39;已取消&#39;, color: &#39;#ef4444&#39;, icon: &#39;x&#39; },&#10;};&#10;&#10;function getStatusDisplay(status: OrderStatus): StatusDisplay {&#10;  return statusConfig[status] ?? { label: &#39;未知&#39;, color: &#39;#6b7280&#39;, icon: &#39;question&#39; };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> statusConfig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">OrderStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">StatusDisplay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pending: { label: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'待处理'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, color: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#f59e0b'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, icon: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'clock'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  confirmed: { label: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'已确认'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, color: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#3b82f6'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, icon: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'check'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  shipped: { label: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'已发货'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, color: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#8b5cf6'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, icon: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'truck'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  delivered: { label: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'已送达'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, color: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#10b981'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, icon: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'package'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  cancelled: { label: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'已取消'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, color: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#ef4444'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, icon: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'x'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getStatusDisplay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StatusDisplay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> statusConfig[status] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { label: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'未知'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, color: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#6b7280'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, icon: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'question'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>查找表比 switch/case 更紧凑，且修改时只需调整数据，不需要改逻辑。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"可读性度量与评估\">可读性度量与评估</h2><h3 id=\"代码可读性的四个维度\">代码可读性的四个维度</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>评估方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>表面可读性</td>\n<td>格式、缩进、命名一致性</td>\n<td>Linter 自动检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义可读性</td>\n<td>能否理解每行代码的含义</td>\n<td>新成员 Code Review</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构可读性</td>\n<td>模块间的依赖和调用关系是否清晰</td>\n<td>依赖图分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>概念可读性</td>\n<td>架构意图和设计决策是否透明</td>\n<td>ADR 文档覆盖度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"代码作为沟通媒介\">代码作为沟通媒介</h3><p>代码本质上是开发者之间的对话。写代码时应该假设读者：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[假设读者] --&gt; B[了解编程语言基础]&#10;    A --&gt; C[不了解你的业务背景]&#10;    A --&gt; D[没时间阅读所有相关文件]&#10;    A --&gt; E[可能在半夜排查故障]&#10;    B --&gt; F[不用解释语法]&#10;    C --&gt; F2[需要解释业务概念]&#10;    D --&gt; F3[每个文件应独立可理解]&#10;    E --&gt; F4[命名和结构要直觉化]\">graph TD\n    A[假设读者] --&gt; B[了解编程语言基础]\n    A --&gt; C[不了解你的业务背景]\n    A --&gt; D[没时间阅读所有相关文件]\n    A --&gt; E[可能在半夜排查故障]\n    B --&gt; F[不用解释语法]\n    C --&gt; F2[需要解释业务概念]\n    D --&gt; F3[每个文件应独立可理解]\n    E --&gt; F4[命名和结构要直觉化]</pre><p>基于这些假设，自解释的代码比注释更可靠，因为注释会过时，而好的命名随代码一起演化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"可读性检查清单\">可读性检查清单</h3><p>在提交代码前，用以下清单做快速审视：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查项</th>\n<th>通过标准</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>所有变量名是否揭示意图</td>\n<td>不需要上下文即可理解含义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数名是否描述行为</td>\n<td>读函数名就知道它做什么</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>布尔变量是否使用正向命名</td>\n<td><code>isValid</code> 优于 <code>isNotInvalid</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否存在魔术数字</td>\n<td>所有数字都有命名常量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌套深度是否 ≤ 3</td>\n<td>使用卫语句和提前返回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数长度是否 ≤ 20 行</td>\n<td>超过则考虑拆分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否有连续的条件判断</td>\n<td>考虑使用查找表或策略模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型名是否体现概念边界</td>\n<td>Input/Record/ViewModel 清晰分层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"命名的演进\">命名的演进</h2><p>命名不是一次性决策。随着对领域理解的加深，名字应该随之演进。重命名是最安全的重构之一——现代 IDE 可以在毫秒内完成全局重命名，而好名字带来的理解收益是持续的。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>理解阶段</th>\n<th>命名示例</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>初始理解</td>\n<td><code>data</code>, <code>result</code></td>\n<td>模糊，占位性质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>初步清晰</td>\n<td><code>userData</code>, <code>queryResult</code></td>\n<td>加了类型前缀，但仍不精确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>领域理解</td>\n<td><code>customerProfile</code>, <code>searchMatches</code></td>\n<td>使用领域词汇</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度理解</td>\n<td><code>eligibleSubscribers</code>, <code>rankedCandidates</code></td>\n<td>精确描述数据的业务含义</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>不要害怕重命名。每一次重命名都是对代码理解的一次提升，也是给下一个阅读者的礼物。命名越精准，代码越能在未来的变更中保持清晰。</p>\n<p>优秀的命名是整洁代码的基石。当团队中的每个成员都对命名保持高标准时，代码库会自然地趋向自解释，评审效率随之提升，新成员的上手速度也会显著加快。命名不是小事——它是代码质量最直观的指标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>命名是&quot;计算机科学中两件难事&quot;之一，难在它要求你先真正理解概念的本质。</li>\n<li>意图揭示原则要求名字自解释，能回答是什么、做什么、为什么存在。</li>\n<li>误导性命名比模糊命名更危险，因为它传递错误的类型或行为信息。</li>\n<li>变量、函数、类与接口各有命名策略，共同点是暴露职责而非实现细节。</li>\n<li>卫语句、解释变量、查找表是可读性进阶的三个可操作技巧。</li>\n<li>命名是演进式的：随理解加深而重命名，是收益持续且风险极低的重构。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"命名与可读性","id":"命名与可读性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"命名的重要性","id":"命名的重要性"},{"level":2,"text":"命名的基本原则","id":"命名的基本原则"},{"level":3,"text":"意图揭示原则","id":"意图揭示原则"},{"level":3,"text":"避免误导","id":"避免误导"},{"level":3,"text":"有意义的区分","id":"有意义的区分"},{"level":2,"text":"各类实体的命名策略","id":"各类实体的命名策略"},{"level":3,"text":"变量命名","id":"变量命名"},{"level":3,"text":"函数命名","id":"函数命名"},{"level":3,"text":"类与接口命名","id":"类与接口命名"},{"level":2,"text":"可读性进阶技巧","id":"可读性进阶技巧"},{"level":3,"text":"卫语句消除嵌套","id":"卫语句消除嵌套"},{"level":3,"text":"用解释变量替代复杂表达式","id":"用解释变量替代复杂表达式"},{"level":3,"text":"用查找表替代条件链","id":"用查找表替代条件链"},{"level":2,"text":"可读性度量与评估","id":"可读性度量与评估"},{"level":3,"text":"代码可读性的四个维度","id":"代码可读性的四个维度"},{"level":3,"text":"代码作为沟通媒介","id":"代码作为沟通媒介"},{"level":3,"text":"可读性检查清单","id":"可读性检查清单"},{"level":2,"text":"命名的演进","id":"命名的演进"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"整洁代码原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-craftsmanship/code-quality-standards/clean-code-principles"},"next":{"title":"代码风格强制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-craftsmanship/code-quality-standards/code-style-enforcement"}}